   "source": [
    "# BioDYM Material Flow Analysis - Scientific Notebook\n",
    "\n",
    "A streamlined notebook for Material Flow Analysis using the BioDYM framework.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Workflow\n",
    "1. **Load Excel File** - Define input data\n",
    "2. **Confirm Configuration** - Review loaded data and settings\n",
    "3. **Run Calculation** - Execute MFA analysis\n",
    "4. **Mass Balance Check** - Verify calculation accuracy\n",
    "5. **Visualizations** - Display all available plots\n",
    "\n",
    "---"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a7e9b1a6",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Setup and Imports"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "5115779e",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import os\n",
    "import sys\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import plotly.graph_objects as go\n",
    "import plotly.express as px\n",
    "from plotly.subplots import make_subplots\n",
    "from IPython.display import display, HTML, Markdown"
   ]
  },
